        <p>This is not about using big words to sound impressive. Vocabulary performance at its best is invisible - it produces communication that feels clear, precise, and authoritative without drawing attention to itself. Here are the categories of professional vocabulary worth building, with examples of high-value words in each and practical guidance on how to make them genuinely yours.</p>

